# CLAUDE.example.md is the sanitised version that ships.
CLAUDE.md
# Split into one per kind of session (2026-07-26), with debug added 2026-07-27.
# They start as identical copies of the old file and are expected to diverge;
# LEGACY_CLAUDE.md is the common ancestor, kept until they have grown apart
# enough to be worth reading on their own. Public versions come later, if the
# split earns them — CLAUDE.example.md is still the one that ships.
LEGACY_CLAUDE.md
CODER CLAUDE.md
DESIGNER CLAUDE.md
DRAFT CLAUDE.md
DEBUG CLAUDE.md

